"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2923076923076922" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="1.4" y="1.4" width="3.8" height="3.8" rx="0.9"></rect><rect x="6.8" y="1.4" width="3.8" height="3.8" rx="0.9"></rect><rect x="1.4" y="6.8" width="3.8" height="3.8" rx="0.9"></rect><rect x="6.8" y="6.8" width="3.8" height="3.8" rx="0.9"></rect></svg></span>Workspaces</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="settings-tab-remote" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="settings-panel-remote" tabindex="-1" data-testid="settings-tab-button-remote" data-icon="antenna.radiowaves" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-[12px] transition-colors duration-100" style="background: transparent; color: var(--kelpi-fg-secondary, #9A9AA0);" data-hovered="false"><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2923076923076922" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6" cy="5.4" r="1.1"></circle><path d="M6 6.5v4.3"></path><path d="M3.4 7.6a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 0-4.9"></path><path d="M8.6 2.7a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 0 4.9"></path><path d="M1.7 9.2a6.4 6.4 0 0 1 0-8.1"></path><path d="M10.3 1.1a6.4 6.4 0 0 1 0 8.1"></path></svg></span>Remote</button></div><div role="tabpanel" id="settings-panel-workspaces" aria-labelledby="settings-tab-workspaces" data-testid="settings-panel" class="min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4" data-testid="settings-tab-workspaces"><section class="flex flex-col gap-1.5" data-testid="workspaces-section"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Workspaces</h3><div data-settings-card="true" data-testid="workspaces-section-card" class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-md" style="background: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.06);"><div data-settings-row="true" class="flex flex-col" style="padding: 6px 10px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-testid="confirm-delete-row"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Confirm before deleting a workspace with active agents</span><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center" style="width: 38px; height: 22px;" data-hovered="false"><input role="switch" aria-label="Confirm before deleting a workspace with active agents" class="m-0 block rounded-full" style="appearance: none; width: 38px; height: 22px; background: var(--kelpi-accent, #6F9BD8); border: 1px solid var(--kelpi-accent, #6F9BD8); transition: background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease; cursor: default;" data-testid="confirm-delete-toggle" type="checkbox" checked=""><span aria-hidden="true" data-testid="confirm-delete-toggle-thumb" class="pointer-events-none absolute rounded-full" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; top: 2px; left: 18px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: left 160ms ease;"></span></span></div></div><span class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">Applies to this window and every other client. kelpi workspace delete --force bypasses it regardless.</span></div></div><div data-settings-row="true" class="flex flex-col" style="padding: 6px 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--kelpi-border, #24242B);"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-testid="expand-group-on-drop-row"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Expand group when a workspace is dropped into it</span><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center" style="width: 38px; height: 22px;" data-hovered="false"><input role="switch" aria-label="Expand group when a workspace is dropped into it" class="m-0 block rounded-full" style="appearance: none; width: 38px; height: 22px; background: var(--kelpi-accent, #6F9BD8); border: 1px solid var(--kelpi-accent, #6F9BD8); transition: background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease; cursor: default;" data-testid="expand-group-on-drop-toggle" type="checkbox" checked=""><span aria-hidden="true" data-testid="expand-group-on-drop-toggle-thumb" class="pointer-events-none absolute rounded-full" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; top: 2px; left: 18px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: left 160ms ease;"></span></span></div></div><span class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">Dropping a workspace onto a collapsed group opens the group so you can see where the row landed. Off leaves it collapsed.</span></div></div><div data-settings-row="true" class="flex flex-col" style="padding: 6px 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--kelpi-border, #24242B);"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-testid="confirm-quit-row"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Confirm before quitting with active agents</span><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center" style="width: 38px; height: 22px;" data-hovered="false"><input role="switch" aria-label="Confirm before quitting with active agents" class="m-0 block rounded-full" style="appearance: none; width: 38px; height: 22px; background: var(--kelpi-accent, #6F9BD8); border: 1px solid var(--kelpi-accent, #6F9BD8); transition: background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease; cursor: default;" data-testid="confirm-quit-toggle" type="checkbox" checked=""><span aria-hidden="true" data-testid="confirm-quit-toggle-thumb" class="pointer-events-none absolute rounded-full" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; top: 2px; left: 18px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: left 160ms ease;"></span></span></div></div><span class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">Desktop app only: ⌘Q asks first while agents are running. The dialog's “Don't ask again” checkbox writes this same setting.</span></div></div></div></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-1.5" data-testid="panes-section"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Panes</h3><div data-settings-card="true" data-testid="panes-section-card" class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-md" style="background: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.06);"><div data-settings-row="true" class="flex flex-col" style="padding: 6px 10px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-testid="focus-follows-mouse-row"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Focus follows mouse</span><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center" style="width: 38px; height: 22px;" data-hovered="false"><input role="switch" aria-label="Focus follows mouse" class="m-0 block rounded-full" style="appearance: none; width: 38px; height: 22px; background: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.34); border: 1px solid rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.55); transition: background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease; cursor: default;" data-testid="focus-follows-mouse-toggle" type="checkbox"><span aria-hidden="true" data-testid="focus-follows-mouse-toggle-thumb" class="pointer-events-none absolute rounded-full" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; top: 2px; left: 2px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: left 160ms ease;"></span></span></div></div><span class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">Hovering a pane focuses it after the delay below.</span></div></div><div data-settings-row="true" class="flex flex-col" style="padding: 6px 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--kelpi-border, #24242B);"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-testid="clipboard-write-row"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Let programs write the clipboard</span><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center" style="width: 38px; height: 22px;" data-hovered="false"><input role="switch" aria-label="Let programs write the clipboard" class="m-0 block rounded-full" style="appearance: none; width: 38px; height: 22px; background: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.34); border: 1px solid rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.55); transition: background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease; cursor: default;" data-testid="clipboard-write-toggle" type="checkbox"><span aria-hidden="true" data-testid="clipboard-write-toggle-thumb" class="pointer-events-none absolute rounded-full" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; top: 2px; left: 2px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: left 160ms ease;"></span></span></div></div><span class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">A program in a terminal pane can put text on your clipboard with OSC 52 - how tmux, vim and remote shells copy. Off by default. Programs can never READ your clipboard: Kelpi refuses those requests whatever this is set to.</span></div></div></div></section><p class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">Worktree paths, repository auto-detection and sidebar placement are on the General tab.</p><p data-testid="settings-footer-note" class="pt-1 text-[11px] leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">Config: <span class="font-mono">~/.config/nex/config</span></p></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`the Settings window on a desktop > renders byte-identical markup to the one that shipped before B5 1`] = `"<div data-testid="settings-backdrop" class="absolute inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center" style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.62);"><div data-testid="settings-window" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Settings" class="flex h-[min(620px,90%)] w-[clamp(560px,92%,880px)] flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[10px]" style="background: var(--kelpi-surface, #101013); border: 1px solid var(--kelpi-border, #24242B); box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);"><div data-testid="settings-toolbar" class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 border-b px-3 py-2" style="background: var(--kelpi-header-bg, #13131A); border-color: var(--kelpi-border, #24242B);"><span class="text-[12px] font-semibold" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Settings</span><span class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">General</span><span class="ml-auto"><button type="button" data-hovered="false" data-testid="settings-close" class="whitespace-nowrap rounded border px-2 py-1 text-center text-[11px] transition-colors duration-100 disabled:opacity-40" style="border-color: var(--kelpi-border, #24242B); color: var(--kelpi-fg-secondary, #9A9AA0); background: transparent;">Close</button></span></div><div class="flex min-h-0 flex-1"><div role="tablist" aria-label="Settings sections" aria-orientation="vertical" data-testid="settings-tabs" class="flex w-44 shrink-0 flex-col gap-1 border-r p-2" style="border-color: var(--kelpi-border, #24242B); background: var(--kelpi-sidebar-bg, #0C0C10);"><button type="button" role="tab" id="settings-tab-general" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="settings-panel-general" tabindex="0" data-testid="settings-tab-button-general" data-icon="gear" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-[12px] transition-colors duration-100" style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--kelpi-accent, #6F9BD8) 18%, transparent); color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);" data-hovered="false"><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2923076923076922" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3.5"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="1.35"></circle><path d="M9.50 6.00L10.90 6.00M8.47 8.47L9.46 9.46M6.00 9.50L6.00 10.90M3.53 8.47L2.54 9.46M2.50 6.00L1.10 6.00M3.53 3.53L2.54 2.54M6.00 2.50L6.00 1.10M8.47 3.53L9.46 2.54"></path></svg></span>General</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="settings-tab-appearance" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="settings-panel-appearance" tabindex="-1" data-testid="settings-tab-button-appearance" data-icon="paintbrush" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-[12px] transition-colors duration-100" style="background: transparent; color: var(--kelpi-fg-secondary, #9A9AA0);" data-hovered="false"><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2923076923076922" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10.4 1.6 6.1 5.9"></path><path d="M5.0 4.6 7.4 7.0 5.1 9.3 2.7 6.9z"></path><path d="M2.9 9.1 1.3 10.7"></path></svg></span>Appearance</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="settings-tab-repositories" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="settings-panel-repositories" tabindex="-1" data-testid="settings-tab-button-repositories" data-icon="externaldrive" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-[12px] transition-colors duration-100" style="background: transparent; color: var(--kelpi-fg-secondary, #9A9AA0);" data-hovered="false"><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2923076923076922" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="1.2" y="3.6" width="9.6" height="4.8" rx="1.2"></rect><circle cx="8.8" cy="6" r="0.6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle><path d="M3 6h3.2"></path></svg></span>Repositories</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="settings-tab-labels" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="settings-panel-labels" tabindex="-1" data-testid="settings-tab-button-labels" data-icon="tag" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-[12px] transition-colors duration-100" style="background: transparent; color: var(--kelpi-fg-secondary, #9A9AA0);" data-hovered="false"><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2923076923076922" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6.3 1.4H10a.6.6 0 0 1 .6.6v3.7a1 1 0 0 1-.3.7l-4 4a1 1 0 0 1-1.4 0L1.6 7.1a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.4l4-4a1 1 0 0 1 .7-.3z"></path><circle cx="8.4" cy="3.6" r="0.75"></circle></svg></span>Labels</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="settings-tab-profiles" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="settings-panel-profiles" tabindex="-1" data-testid="settings-tab-button-profiles" data-icon="person.badge.key" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-[12px] transition-colors duration-100" style="background: transparent; color: var(--kelpi-fg-secondary, #9A9AA0);" data-hovered="false"><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2923076923076922" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="4.7" cy="3.5" r="1.9"></circle><path d="M1.3 10.4c0-2 1.5-3.4 3.4-3.4 .8 0 1.5.2 2.1.6"></path><circle cx="8.4" cy="7.9" r="1.4"></circle><path d="M9.5 8.7 11 10.2M10.1 9.3l-.6.6"></path></svg></span>Profiles</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="settings-tab-keybindings" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="settings-panel-keybindings" tabindex="-1" data-testid="settings-tab-button-keybindings" data-icon="command" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-[12px] transition-colors duration-100" style="background: transparent; color: var(--kelpi-fg-secondary, #9A9AA0);" data-hovered="false"><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2923076923076922" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4.6 4.6h2.8v2.8H4.6zM4.6 4.6H3.2a1.4 1.4 0 1 1 1.4-1.4zM7.4 4.6h1.4a1.4 1.4 0 1 0-1.4-1.4zM4.6 7.4H3.2a1.4 1.4 0 1 0 1.4 1.4zM7.4 7.4h1.4a1.4 1.4 0 1 1-1.4 1.4z"></path></svg></span>Keybindings</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="settings-tab-web" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="settings-panel-web" tabindex="-1" data-testid="settings-tab-button-web" data-icon="globe" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-[12px] transition-colors duration-100" style="background: transparent; color: var(--kelpi-fg-secondary, #9A9AA0);" data-hovered="false"><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2923076923076922" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="4.8"></circle><path d="M1.2 6h9.6"></path><path d="M6 1.2c1.5 1.4 2.3 3 2.3 4.8S7.5 9.4 6 10.8C4.5 9.4 3.7 7.8 3.7 6s.8-3.4 2.3-4.8z"></path></svg></span>Web</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="settings-tab-workspaces" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="settings-panel-workspaces" tabindex="-1" data-testid="settings-tab-button-workspaces" data-icon="square.grid.2x2" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-[12px] transition-colors duration-100" style="background: transparent; color: var(--kelpi-fg-secondary, #9A9AA0);" data-hovered="false"><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2923076923076922" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="1.4" y="1.4" width="3.8" height="3.8" rx="0.9"></rect><rect x="6.8" y="1.4" width="3.8" height="3.8" rx="0.9"></rect><rect x="1.4" y="6.8" width="3.8" height="3.8" rx="0.9"></rect><rect x="6.8" y="6.8" width="3.8" height="3.8" rx="0.9"></rect></svg></span>Workspaces</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="settings-tab-remote" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="settings-panel-remote" tabindex="-1" data-testid="settings-tab-button-remote" data-icon="antenna.radiowaves" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-[12px] transition-colors duration-100" style="background: transparent; color: var(--kelpi-fg-secondary, #9A9AA0);" data-hovered="false"><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2923076923076922" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6" cy="5.4" r="1.1"></circle><path d="M6 6.5v4.3"></path><path d="M3.4 7.6a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 0-4.9"></path><path d="M8.6 2.7a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 0 4.9"></path><path d="M1.7 9.2a6.4 6.4 0 0 1 0-8.1"></path><path d="M10.3 1.1a6.4 6.4 0 0 1 0 8.1"></path></svg></span>Remote</button></div><div role="tabpanel" id="settings-panel-general" aria-labelledby="settings-tab-general" data-testid="settings-panel" class="min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4" data-testid="settings-tab-general"><section class="flex flex-col gap-1.5" data-testid="general-worktrees"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Worktrees</h3><div data-settings-card="true" data-testid="general-worktrees-card" class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-md" style="background: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.06);"><div data-settings-row="true" class="flex flex-col" style="padding: 6px 10px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-testid="worktree-base-path"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex shrink-0 flex-col"><span class="text-[12px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Base path</span></div><span class="flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1"><input aria-label="Base path" placeholder="~/nex/worktrees/<repo>" data-testid="worktree-base-path-input" class="min-w-0 flex-1 border-0 bg-transparent px-0 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] outline-none" style="background: transparent; color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);" type="text" value="~/kelpi/worktrees/<repo>"></span></div></div></div></div><p class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">Worktrees are created at &lt;base path&gt;/&lt;name&gt;. Use &lt;repo&gt; in the base path to substitute the repository: at the start it resolves to the full repo path (e.g. &lt;repo&gt;/.claude/worktrees), elsewhere it resolves to the repository's directory name (e.g. ~/nex/worktrees/&lt;repo&gt;).</p></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-1.5" data-testid="general-repositories"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Repositories</h3><div data-settings-card="true" data-testid="general-repositories-card" class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-md" style="background: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.06);"><div data-settings-row="true" class="flex flex-col" style="padding: 6px 10px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-testid="auto-detect-repos-row"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Auto-detect from pane directories</span><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center" style="width: 38px; height: 22px;" data-hovered="false"><input role="switch" aria-label="Auto-detect from pane directories" class="m-0 block rounded-full" style="appearance: none; width: 38px; height: 22px; background: var(--kelpi-accent, #6F9BD8); border: 1px solid var(--kelpi-accent, #6F9BD8); transition: background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease; cursor: default;" data-testid="auto-detect-repos-toggle" type="checkbox" checked=""><span aria-hidden="true" data-testid="auto-detect-repos-toggle-thumb" class="pointer-events-none absolute rounded-full" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; top: 2px; left: 18px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: left 160ms ease;"></span></span></div></div><span class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">When a pane's working directory is inside a Git repository, associate that repo (or worktree) with the workspace. Removed a few seconds after no pane remains in it; manually added repos are never auto-removed.</span></div></div></div></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-1.5" data-testid="general-workspaces"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Workspaces</h3><div data-settings-card="true" data-testid="general-workspaces-card" class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-md" style="background: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.06);"><div data-settings-row="true" class="flex flex-col" style="padding: 6px 10px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-testid="inherit-group-row"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Inherit group when creating a new workspace</span><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center" style="width: 38px; height: 22px;" data-hovered="false"><input role="switch" aria-label="Inherit group when creating a new workspace" class="m-0 block rounded-full" style="appearance: none; width: 38px; height: 22px; background: var(--kelpi-accent, #6F9BD8); border: 1px solid var(--kelpi-accent, #6F9BD8); transition: background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease; cursor: default;" data-testid="inherit-group-toggle" type="checkbox" checked=""><span aria-hidden="true" data-testid="inherit-group-toggle-thumb" class="pointer-events-none absolute rounded-full" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; top: 2px; left: 18px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: left 160ms ease;"></span></span></div></div><span class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">When the active workspace belongs to a group, new workspaces are created inside that same group. Disable to always create at the top level.</span></div></div><div data-settings-row="true" class="flex flex-col" style="padding: 6px 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--kelpi-border, #24242B);"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-testid="new-workspace-placement"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col"><span class="text-[12px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">New workspace placement</span></div><select aria-label="New workspace placement" data-testid="new-workspace-placement-select" class="shrink-0 rounded border px-1.5 py-1 text-[11px]" style="border-color: var(--kelpi-border, #24242B); background: var(--kelpi-surface, #101013); color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);"><option value="near-selection">Next to selection</option><option value="end-of-list">End of list</option></select></div><span class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">Where a newly created workspace is inserted. “Next to selection” places it immediately after the active workspace's slot; “End of list” always appends.</span></div></div><div data-settings-row="true" class="flex flex-col" style="padding: 6px 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--kelpi-border, #24242B);"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-testid="new-group-placement"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col"><span class="text-[12px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">New group placement</span></div><select aria-label="New group placement" data-testid="new-group-placement-select" class="shrink-0 rounded border px-1.5 py-1 text-[11px]" style="border-color: var(--kelpi-border, #24242B); background: var(--kelpi-surface, #101013); color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);"><option value="near-selection">Next to selection</option><option value="end-of-list">End of list</option></select></div><span class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">The same choice for a newly created group.</span></div></div></div></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-1.5" data-testid="general-network"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">Network</h3><div data-settings-card="true" data-testid="general-network-card" class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-md" style="background: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.06);"><div data-settings-row="true" class="flex flex-col" style="padding: 6px 10px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-testid="tcp-listener-row"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg, #E6E6EA);">TCP listener</span><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center" style="width: 38px; height: 22px;" data-hovered="false"><input role="switch" aria-label="TCP listener" class="m-0 block rounded-full" style="appearance: none; width: 38px; height: 22px; background: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.34); border: 1px solid rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.55); transition: background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease; cursor: default;" data-testid="tcp-listener-toggle" type="checkbox"><span aria-hidden="true" data-testid="tcp-listener-toggle-thumb" class="pointer-events-none absolute rounded-full" style="width: 18px; height: 18px; top: 2px; left: 2px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: left 160ms ease;"></span></span></div></div><span class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">Disabled - the Unix control socket is the only transport.</span></div></div></div><p class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">The control socket's optional TCP listener on 127.0.0.1, for dev containers and SSH tunnels. It binds when the daemon starts, so a change here applies on the next daemon start.</p></section><p class="text-[11px]" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">Focus-follows-mouse and the two confirmation dialogs (workspace delete, quit) are on the Workspaces tab.</p><p data-testid="settings-footer-note" class="pt-1 text-[11px] leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--kelpi-fg-tertiary, #6A6A72);">Config: <span class="font-mono">~/.config/nex/config</span>. Every value here is a line in that file - edit it by hand and this window follows.</p></div></div></div></div></div>"`;
